Design a Food Delivery Application (Zomato/Swiggy/Uber Eats)
Design a platform that allows users to search restaurants and order food online from there.

1
Gathering of the requirements

main three parts :- user , delivery partners , restaurant
                    give the order , helps in delivery of food , accepts the order
so , ask interviewee which part to explore

Functional Requirements :-
-> User should be able to register into our application.
-> List down all the nearby restaurants based on user location.
-> User should able to search restaurants based on title and menu.
-> Show all the menus in the display of the restaurants.
-> User should be able to select various item(s) in the cart and make the payment to confirm order from nearest restaurant.
-> Once the restaurant accept , find nearby delivery partner based on driver location , optimised delivery time.
-> Once the delivery partner pick up the order , give almost real time location of delivery partner to user.
-> User should get notification on all stages and get past orders in the profile.

Non-functional Requirements :-
-> Scale :- 50M users and 1M restaurants
-> CAP theorem :- Application should be highly available based on searching and our application should be highly
                  consistent based on paymnents and order of food from restaurant.

